## Reference Implementations (Python & Java)

```python
# Denormalized read-optimized insert (Python)
def create_post(db, author_id: str, title: str, body: str):
    author = db.query_one("SELECT display_name, avatar_url FROM users WHERE id = %s", (author_id,))
    db.execute(
        "INSERT INTO posts (author_id, author_name, author_avatar, title, body) VALUES (%s,%s,%s,%s,%s)",
        (author_id, author["display_name"], author["avatar_url"], title, body),
    )
```

```java
// Denormalized read-optimized insert (Java)
public void createPost(String authorId, String title, String body) {
    UserSummary author = userRepo.findSummary(authorId);
    postRepo.insert(authorId, author.displayName(), author.avatarUrl(), title, body);
}
```
